  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultant contract - Development of engagement initiative 2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ministry of Foreign Affairs has initiated a process to identify the strategic partners for the period 2022 to 2025 among civil society organizations and humanitarian organisations. 

As part of the process of designing the framework for future strategic partnership agreements, a stronger focus is desired on a number of topics - including popular engagement in Denmark. The background is that the industry faces challenges that require cooperation and joint efforts to increase Danes&apos; understanding and support for development cooperation.

The purpose of the assignment is to develop a format that Danida and the strategic partners can collaborate on and that answers the challenge of engaging new target groups in development cooperation. 
In the development of the format, relevant partners must be involved - including future strategic partners and partners who can reach the target groups we want to reach (media, festivals or the like). This is, among other things, to ensure active co-ownership on the part of the partners.</narrative>
  </description>
